# Phase & Turn Commit Gate

**Primary rule:** `.cursor/rules/auto-commit-absolute.mdc` — read and follow every session.

## Phase completion (additive)

When a roadmap phase passes audit:

1. Ensure working tree matches a **full backup** (same standard as auto-commit).
2. Commit message: `Complete Phase N: <short description>`
3. Tag: `phase-N`
4. Record hash in `IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md`

Phase commit is **in addition to** per-turn commits — not a substitute.
